# Sky settings

option.VANILLA_SUN                     = Vanilla Sun Texture
option.VANILLA_SUN.comment = When enabled, shows Minecraft's default sun texture. When disabled, uses the shader's procedural sun disc.
option.VANILLA_MOON                    = Vanilla Moon Texture
option.VANILLA_MOON.comment = When enabled, shows Minecraft's default moon texture. When disabled, uses the shader's procedural moon disc.
option.SUN_ANGULAR_RADIUS              = Sun Size
option.SUN_ANGULAR_RADIUS.comment = Adjusts the apparent size of the sun disc in the sky. Larger = bigger sun and softer shadows due to larger light source.
option.MOON_ANGULAR_RADIUS             = Moon Size
option.MOON_ANGULAR_RADIUS.comment = Adjusts the apparent size of the moon disc at night. Larger = bigger moon and softer moon shadows.
option.ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION_BOOST     = Atmosfeer Verzadigings Boost
option.ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION_BOOST.comment              = Verhoogt de verzadiging van de lucht en zonlicht gebaseert op de tijd van de dag.
option.ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION_BOOST_INTENSITY            = Atmosfeer Verzadiging Boost Intensiteit
option.ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION_BOOST_INTENSITY.comment    = verandert de intensiteit van Atmosfeer Verzadiging Boost.
option.STARS                           = Sterren
option.STARS.comment                   = Sterren in de nachtlucht.
option.STARS_INTENSITY                 = Intensiteit
option.STARS_INTENSITY.comment         = Wijzigt de felheid van de sterren.
option.STARS_COVERAGE                  = Dekking
option.STARS_COVERAGE.comment          = Wijzigt het aantal sterren.
option.GALAXY                          = Sterrenstelsel
option.GALAXY.comment                  = Sterrenstelsel-afbeelding in de nachtlucht.
option.GALAXY_INTENSITY                = Sterrenstelsel Intensiteit
option.GALAXY_INTENSITY.comment        = Wijzigt de felheid van het sterrenstelsel.
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS                = Crepuscular Rays
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS.comment = Enables god rays (light shafts) visible when the sun is near the horizon through fog and clouds. Best seen at sunrise/sunset.
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS_INTENSITY      = Ray Intensity
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the brightness and contrast of god rays. Higher = more visible light shafts.
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS_STEPS_HORIZON  = Horizon Quality
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS_STEPS_HORIZON.comment = Adjusts ray-marching quality toward the horizon. Higher = smoother, more accurate rays at higher GPU cost.
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS_STEPS_ZENITH   = Zenith Quality
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS_STEPS_ZENITH.comment = Adjusts ray-marching quality toward the zenith (straight up). Higher = smoother rays overhead at higher cost.
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH                 = Bliksemflits
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH.comment = Controls lightning flash.
option.RAINBOWS                        = Rainbows
option.RAINBOWS.comment = When enabled, a faint rainbow appears opposite the sun during and just after rain.
option.END_SUN_EFFECT                  = End Zon Effect
option.END_SUN_EFFECT.comment = Controls end sun effect.

